{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301290","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130129001:1":{"text":"작은 물고기가 더 맛있는 거예요! 사실 얘네도 제대로 먹지를 못해서 다 자라도 그렇게 크지 않아요.","source_cn":"小的才好吃！其实是它们也没什么吃的，长不太大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CEFB47D74924D80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130129002:1":{"text":"하지만 이 정도도 감지덕지죠. 먹을 게 없을 땐 이 작은 물고기가 저희의 주식이에요.","source_cn":"但我们已经很感激了，没有太多食物的时候，小鱼就是我们主...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB860AC8271133332","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130129003:1":{"text":"그래서 저희는 항상 감사한 마음으로 남김없이 먹어 치워요!","source_cn":"所以我们都会带着虔诚的心，一点不剩地吃掉它呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFD31589BF03BBCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血赞多尔":{"text":"잔다르","source":"小蛮血赞多尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}